{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107290","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910729001:1":{"text":"ここの泡……どうして散らばってるんだろう。誰かがバラバラにしたのかな。","source_cn":"这些气泡……为什么散落一地？是谁把它们打散了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F15A0887D11DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910729002:1":{"text":"そんなのは……どうでもいい。ここでは、何が起きても……おかしくない……","source_cn":"这……不重要。这里……出现什么都不奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0874D2A7649C1CA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910729003:1":{"text":"この建物も、泡も……頭の中に浮かぶ光景も……","source_cn":"这座建筑，这些气泡……那些……出现在脑中的景象……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBADAFF43ACE25304","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910729004:1":{"text":"それから……この音も……！","source_cn":"那些……声音……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B16A17AE1F89FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910729005:1":{"text":"カーリュさん！大丈夫？もし――","source_cn":"卡律先生！你还好吗，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF04E671DE8CBE9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910729006:1":{"text":"……立ち止まるな！","source_cn":"……不要停下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB242B96B892FA464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910729007:1":{"text":"音が……うるさい。音に呑まれる前に……泡を集めて、ここから出るぞ……！","source_cn":"声音……太吵了。在它……填满我们之前，收集那些气泡……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8300D9CBA35480A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"エフィラ","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡律":{"text":"カーリュ","source":"卡律","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}